      "title": "The Complete Money Map",
      "content": "## **The Complete Money Map** \n\n|Layer<br>Cash flow|Question<br>What enters, leaves, stays, and grows?|Skill<br>Budgeting, tracking, automation|\n|---|---|---|\n|Protection|What can destroy progress?|Insurance, emergency fund, low<br>debt, security|\n|Growth|How does surplus multiply?|Investing, business, skills,<br>compounding|\n|Freedom|What choices does money create?|Runway, ownership, optionality,<br>values|\n\n\n\nThe flow is simple: earn active income, spend less than you earn, protect the base, convert surplus into assets, raise your earning power, and repeat long enough for compounding to matter. The hard part is not the formula; the hard part is behavior under pressure. \n\nYour money system should answer five questions every month: Did my net worth improve? Did my cash flow improve? Did my risk reduce? Did my earning power increase? Did my decisions match my values?"
