      "content": "## **Appendix A: Monthly Money Review Template** \n\n|Area<br>Income|Metric<br>Active + passive income|Target/Question<br>Is it rising or fragile?|\n|---|---|---|\n|Spending|Essential + optional|What can be reduced without hurting life quality?|\n|Saving|Savings rate|Did I save before spending?|\n|Debt|Rate + payoff date|Is bad debt shrinking?|\n|Investing|Amount + allocation|Am I consistent and diversified?|\n|Protection|Emergency fund +<br>insurance|Can I survive disruption?|\n|Growth|Skills + network|Did I increase earning power?|\n\n\n\nRepeat this review every month. The review does not need to be perfect. It needs to be honest. Honest tracking beats complicated planning."
